# Social Media Post Automation

## Overview

A Node.js and n8n based social media post automation workflow that allows users to create and process social media posts through a simple web interface.

The workflow receives post details through a web form and uses an n8n webhook to process the post according to the selected posting mode.

## Features

- Simple web-based post creation form
- Post title and content input
- ALL posting mode
- SPECIFIC platform selection mode
- Facebook processing
- Instagram processing
- X (Twitter) processing
- LinkedIn processing
- Webhook-based communication
- Conditional workflow routing
- Separate platform processing branches
- Post-ready output for each platform

## Technologies Used

- Node.js
- Express.js
- n8n
- JavaScript
- HTML
- CSS
- Webhooks

## Supported Platforms

- Facebook
- Instagram
- X (Twitter)
- LinkedIn

